00:05:18,750 --> 00:05:24,750
It's Just Like Paradise, Only Better Looking.

2
00:10:37,500 --> 00:10:43,500
Dinosaur Island is a adventure, comedy, fantasy film directed by Fred Olen Ray.

3
00:15:56,250 --> 00:16:02,250
Welcome to lush Dinosaur Island, where a tribe of gorgeous cavedwelling warrior
women satisfy the exotic fantasies of five downed military airmen.

4
00:21:15,000 --> 00:21:21,000
Fearsome battles with the island's ferocious maneating dinosaurs are the only
disruption of their seductive pleasures on this island paradise.

5
00:26:33,750 --> 00:26:39,750
Narrowly surviving with their lives, the rugged men fall under the seductive spell
of their lovely captors and soon find their every dream fulfilled.

6
00:31:52,500 --> 00:31:58,500
Capt. Jason Briggs, played by Ross Hagen.

7
00:37:11,250 --> 00:37:17,250
John Skeemer, played by Richard Gabai.

8
00:42:30,000 --> 00:42:36,000
April, played by Antonia Dorian.

9
00:47:48,750 --> 00:47:54,750
May, played by Griffin Drew.

10
00:53:07,500 --> 00:53:13,500
June, played by Michelle Bauer.

11
00:58:26,250 --> 00:58:32,250
