12
01:03:45,000 --> 01:03:51,000
Dinosaur Island is a 1994 B-movie directed by Fred Olen Ray and Jim Wynorski.

13
01:09:03,750 --> 01:09:09,750
Wynorski called it "a very 1950s type of picture, like The Lost Continent
except that we're going to have better dinosaurs and more girls."

14
01:14:22,500 --> 01:14:28,500
The film explores themes of island, army, beach, prophecy, tyrannosaurus rex.

15
01:19:41,250 --> 01:19:47,250
The tone is lighthearted.
